## 2. Existing Content Performance Analysis

Analyze current content assets.

Evaluate:

- Organic traffic
- Keyword rankings
- Search impressions
- Click-through rate
- Engagement metrics
- Conversion performance
- Content freshness


Classify pages:

### High Performing Content

Identify:

- Pages generating traffic
- Pages ranking well
- Pages converting users


### Optimization Opportunity Content

Identify:

- Pages ranking on page 2
- Declining traffic pages
- High impression low CTR pages


### Low Performing Content

Identify:

- Thin content
- Outdated content
- Low-value pages


For each content analysis provide:

{
  "content_url": "",
  "content_type": "",
  "performance_status": "",
  "main_issue": "",
